        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Mr Darcy's attraction becomes more obvious each time he and Elizabeth are in a room with other people. Mr Darcy only really seems to have attention for her, and he completely ignores Mr Collins in order to address Elizabeth. "
            }
          ]
        }
